  "question": {
    "text": "In the expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> first three terms are <math><mn>243</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>810</mn></math> and <math><mn>1080</mn></math> respectively, then the fourth term of the expansion is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
